      <!-- FIX root-cause 2026-08-03: was messageRef="_msg_ServiceOrderStateChange" (same as
           the throw event _A_THROW_SO_STATE_CHANGE) -> Kogito could never bind an incoming
           channel for this catch event (channel name collided with the outgoing producer
           channel), it stayed Active forever, blocking _O_GW_SLA_WAIT and the downstream
